# --- Waitlist form (pick ONE option, then copy this file to .env.local) ---
#
# The forms work in "demo mode" with nothing set (they animate success but do
# NOT save anything). To capture real signups, use either option below.
#
# OPTION A — Formspree / Formcarry / Basin / Getform / Formspark (recommended)
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io (or any of the above)
# 2. Paste the form's POST endpoint here:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
#
# OPTION B — Web3Forms (no account needed, just an email)
# 1. Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com
# 2. Paste it here (the endpoint is filled in for you automatically):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# Submissions include: name, email, role, and the founder/tester fields, plus a
# `source` tag (founder-waitlist / tester-waitlist / footer-newsletter /
# exit-intent) so you can tell where each lead came from.
